{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達今日宣佈，即刻生效，黃仁勳恢復擔任公司總裁、行政總裁及董事會成員。 董事會經與黃仁勳多輪溝通會晤後，一致投票同意恢復其職務；董事會認可黃仁勳態度坦誠，具備領導英偉達的能力。在作出該決定的過程中，董事會聽取了美國政府高層的意見。基於相關意見，董事會確信，黃仁勳復職不會帶來國家安全風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587686.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:36:50.453726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:11:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:06.797977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:06.797977+00:00","content_hash":"89c80abcf84d44bfb598b366d007e2be4c99473837eef4b9a97fe99ca8e3d25c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}